  <item>
    <title>15. 女生独自游玩东南亚：善良的泰国和年轻的越南（附安全版攻略</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68890a048e06fe8de756b644</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68890a048e06fe8de756b644</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Jul 2025 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span>⏰2025.07.15-07.22</span></p><span></span><p><span>💡东南亚近几年负面新闻非常多，泰国游客比疫情前少了2/3，大多数都是第三世界国家，但我就是好奇想去看看，泰兰德可是被国人称之为“快乐老家”呢！越南据说像二三十年前的中国，胡志明市核心房价都飙到了10w。想去，买张机票就去啦！女生，一个人，20多岁，BUFF叠满，勇闯东南亚8天8夜！！！</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part1：骨子里非常善良的泰兰德</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> 朋友们的统一反应「注意安全」</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="358">05:58</a> Sky bar</span><strong><span>俯瞰</span></strong><span>曼谷</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 曼谷令人窒息的</span><strong><span>交通</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="742">12:22</a> </span><strong><span>外卖</span></strong><span>虽1小时才送达，小哥很peace！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="922">15:22</a> 打卡各大旅游</span><strong><span>景点</span></strong><span>：佛教浓＋领导人头像</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1355">22:35</a> 全方面体验曼谷</span><strong><span>日常生活</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1691">28:11</a> 整个城市都是</span><strong><span>香</span></strong><span>的！幸福度高，包容开放</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2071">34:31</a> 女生单独去东南亚旅行安全吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part2：刻着法国DNA、非常年轻的越南</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2501">41:41</a> 遍地摩托车，我</span><strong><span>穿越</span></strong><span>到了20年前的中国</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2768">46:08</a> 最高楼</span><strong><span>俯瞰</span></strong><span>胡志明市，游船看CBD夜景</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3235">53:55</a> 罪恶的红灯区：范老五街</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3499">58:19</a> 吃米其林</span><strong><span>越南粉，观光巴士游遍城市</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3898">64:58</a> 越南离谱的「乞讨文化」</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">70:00</a> 和漂亮越南妹子在餐桌上蹦迪</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4422">73:42</a> 总结：一个人旅游的快乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>泰国旅游攻略（公众号：开开在深圳）👉</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/IYroJUcKDDjJ98oS0sLffA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/IYroJUcKDDjJ98oS0sLffA"><strong><span>女生一人旅游曼谷攻略（绝对安全版）</span></strong></a><br><span>胡志明旅游攻略（公众号：开开在深圳）👉</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/r-tEpiAXBNPbcZfZssC-bw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/r-tEpiAXBNPbcZfZssC-bw"><strong><span>胡志明市，一座被忽略的年轻城市，建议都去看看</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>《我们的二十岁》《00后就是这样》听友群</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位优秀的00后或者想了解00后，想跟我们一起交流的朋友进群！欢迎添加微信号：</span><strong><span>kaikaiya2023</span></strong><span>（我的wx），记得备注你的昵称+年龄+职业哦！如果可以给我发一个简短的自我介绍，那就更棒了。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>《我们的二十岁》</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>20岁，开启“见自我”的征途</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>拼尽时间与体力，意志力会带您突出重围！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>开开的音频版日记，记录20+岁里每一件有意义的事情</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>《癫狂的00后》</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>听00后的故事，找自己的位置</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>找有意思的朋友聊天</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>播客主：开开</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>关注中老年群体，00后千人公司销冠</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>商业短视频爆款制造机，用户思维超强的私域运营</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>一个靠谱的摩羯，base深圳</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>制作</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>录制、制作、运营：开开</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：《也许有一天》泰国，《伤心剖半》越南</span></p>]]></description>
