  <item>
    <title>Ep6.秋招第一步：发现自己原来这么垃圾</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6509e089bbe351e61661888a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6509e089bbe351e61661888a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 19 Sep 2023 17:55:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>秋招，开始接受社会对你的【审判】与【估值】，我被迫去面对真正的自己了：我知道我菜，但不知道这么菜。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>求订阅订阅订阅订阅订阅订阅订阅订阅订阅！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a>主动结束实习，原来要花好多的勇气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">05:11</a>兼职送外卖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="679">11:19</a>一个月内辞了2份实习</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【做减法很需要魄力】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="916">15:16</a>状态越来越差，不进则急退退退退退退</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1394">23:14</a>秋招选择：影响我最深的居然是家人对我的看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1781">29:41</a></span><strong><span>不愿面对真实的（差劲的）自己</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2092">34:52</a>“人生本无意义，所以我们做的每件事都有意义”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2162">36:02</a>“我走不出来低谷，是我不想吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>JUST DO IT ！！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>干就完了</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>主播：开开（不知道自己想要什么的秋招人）</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>加微信进听友群：Katids（备注播客）</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>【笑死，群里现在全是秋招人】</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>《我们的二十岁》栏目：</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>分享20岁的我们所关注的一切：自我成长、职业、理想、困惑、人际沟通、亲情爱情友情……</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>记得订阅本播客哦~</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>订阅！订阅！订阅！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>分享一下8月份做的事情</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>照片1：辞去审计实习后，开心的玩了一周</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnXwTH7yDPOY9-zxbgfeIXYvj43W.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>照片2：辞去商务实习的当天晚上，走在路上笑得跟个傻子一样，根本控制不了上扬的嘴角</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fke1TZLLIc87upvbBr7Itcdx4OSi.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>照片3：乱七八糟的投简历、面试</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltFFzjIOoovOFPERgb-w9SP7mY85.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>照片4：唯一能做，也是唯一会做的事情就是减肥。这是我唯一觉得能控制的事情，好无力</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgugRvyJeoEeVT2v2LGa099a3Hr8.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>照片5：不开心就爱吃碳水，汉堡好好吃，披萨好香</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luIC28TfgBQROwOUDsuyWbXA68gB.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqh_viEMq9pknRjsoK5fMFR0bVWr.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
