    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Sep 2023 13:28:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>播客界绝无仅有的骑手第一视角分享：送外卖的那些事儿【不当骑手，永远无法感同身受】</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>求订阅！点赞、评论、收藏、关注，都是创作的巨大动力！</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">01:28</a>前传：大三的我，女生，去兼职送外卖了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> &nbsp;上门店取餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="896">14:56</a> &nbsp;送餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1388">23:08</a> 行车过程：</span><strong><span>按照交通规则行车，完全不可能按时送达</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1825">30:25</a> 骑手收入：一单多少钱、超时扣钱、违规罚钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2053">34:13</a> &nbsp;三大暖心时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2158">35:58</a> 五大黑暗时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2606">43:26</a>送餐也会上瘾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a> 不当骑手，永远无法感同身受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3024">50:24</a>作为消费者能帮到骑手的小举措</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3127">52:07</a>希望外卖行业越来越规范，城市的基建整快点！！！！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>感谢每一位骑手（没有一位骑手是不冒着生命危险在完成任务的）</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>主播：开开（大三即将大四在校生）</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>加微信进听友群：Katids</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《我们的二十岁栏目》</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>分享20岁的我们所关注的一切问题：自我成长、学习、就业、理想、人际交流、亲情友情爱情……</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>记得订阅本播客哦~</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>订阅！订阅！订阅！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>动力！动力！动力！</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>照片1：下午去租车</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrAbFB_Ji7IdapgkdRRWVH3G9rSi.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>照片2：有生以来最甜的一盒西瓜</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgRj8L_lAMIX4X7vs6asrmxxDcIU.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>照片3：下午16点在星巴克休息</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrJ1F62ynLU3jXFSaAYISggUo3UX.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
