  <item>
    <title>【消失的她】何非：又懦弱又垃圾，到死都不肯承认自己无能</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64a6ff09f4ccb12e0b3f172f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64a6ff09f4ccb12e0b3f172f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Jul 2023 17:51:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们何尝不是何非？承认自己无能是很难的事情。</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>求订阅！求点赞、评论、收藏、关注~~~都是创作的巨大动力！！</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">02:04</a>故事的四个转折点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="257">04:17</a>陈麦：理性与感性的结合体。一次次相信、给机会，又一次次的失望、无奈</span></p><span></span><p><span>（最后一个转折之前）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a>最后一个转折，陈麦从“破局者”变成“掌局者”，瞬间对人物下头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1044">17:24</a>木子：爱，敞开给你一个伤害我的机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1803">30:03</a>感谢陈思成：男人果然更懂男人的渣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1859">30:59</a>何非：懦弱！垃圾！打死不肯承认自己无能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2375">39:35</a>其他：</span></p><span></span><p><span>不要最后一个转折，更能展现陈麦的厉害</span></p><span></span><p><span>没特写陈麦表情变化，浪费倪妮演技</span></p><span></span><p><span>文咏珊展现了女生的性魅力（物化女性？）</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈思成的电影商业头脑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2718">45:18</a>我们只会看到我们想看到的</span></p><span></span><p><span>yes~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~</span></p>]]></description>
